70: _ = ∫ p, log ((∂μ/∂ν) p.1).toReal ∂(μ ⊗ₘ κ) + ∫ p, log ((∂μ ⊗ₘ κ/∂μ ⊗ₘ η) p).toReal ∂(μ ⊗ₘ κ)
71: _ = ∫ a, llr μ ν a ∂μ + ∫ p, llr (μ ⊗ₘ κ) (μ ⊗ₘ η) p ∂(μ ⊗ₘ κ)
72: ```
73: 
74: ## TODO
75: 
76: Add a version of the chain rule for the integral form of the contional KL divergence, i.e.
77: `μ[fun x ↦ klDiv (κ x) (η x)]`.
78: 
79: -/
